### RPM inválido

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Disco Teste",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": 50,
    "condition": "Novo",
    "rpmSpeed": 100,
    "stockQuantity": 1,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Estoque inválido

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Disco Teste",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": 50,
    "condition": "Novo",
    "rpmSpeed": 33,
    "stockQuantity": -5,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Preço inválido

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Disco Teste",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": -100,
    "condition": "Novo",
    "rpmSpeed": 33,
    "stockQuantity": 2,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Atualizar preço e estoque

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "price": 219.90,
    "stockQuantity": 8
}

### Criar disco temporário

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Disco Temporario",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": 10,
    "condition": "Usado",
    "rpmSpeed": 33,
    "stockQuantity": 1,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Excluir disco temporário

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar pelo título

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?title=Dark
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por artista

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?artistId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por gênero

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?genreId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por RPM

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?rpmSpeed=33
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Faixa de preço

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?minPrice=180&maxPrice=220
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Somente produtos em estoque

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?inStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtros combinados

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records?genreId=1&rpmSpeed=33&minPrice=100&maxPrice=250&inStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}